        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b305eb4-a0f9-4b30-a1f4-0e398cb6b95c).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47,\r\rThe intel you found in Sapizena proved to be fruitful. It has led us right to one of the Ringmaster&apos;s top lieutenants: Richard Voltaire. Voltaire is an imfamous french art critic that is known for his harsh reviews. However, that is only his public image. In reality, he is a cruel sex trafficker. We believe he has come to Dubai to gather potential new clients. You must eliminate him and retrieve his cell phone in order to gain more intel about the boss.\r\rGood luck 47...",
